        "en": "Rithm Capital announced that its commercial real estate originations subsidiary, Genesis Capital, closed a $375 million securitization of U.S. multifamily loans. The deal, NRMLT 2026-RTL1, is collateralized by a pool of 55 loans and is the first multifamily-only securitization Genesis has closed since Rithm acquired the firm in 2021. Multifamily originations represent 40 percent of Genesis' total origination volume, and rose from $160 million in the first quarter of 2024 to $637 million in the second quarter of 2026.",
